      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Rang Undang-Undang Harta Pusaka Kecil (Pembahagian)(Pindaan) 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 15 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (5) subseksyen yang berikut: “(5A) Where two or more beneficiaries are entitled to a share in any movable property comprised in the estate the Land Administrator may, at his discretion, having regard to the interest of those concerned, order the property to be sold in such manner as may be prescribed.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (6), dengan menggantikan perkataan “and (5)” dengan perkataan “, (5) and (5A)”. Pindaan seksyen 33"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 33(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong perkataan “, Malaysia”. Peruntukan peralihan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Semua petisyen yang berhubungan dengan harta pusaka kecil yang dibuat dengan Pemungut sebelum permulaan kuat kuasa Akta ini hendaklah, pada dan selepas permulaan kuat kuasa Akta ini, diteruskan dan mempunyai kesan seolah-olah Akta ibu tidak dipinda oleh Akta ini."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Semua pendengaran yang berhubungan dengan harta pusaka kecil yang dimulakan atau belum selesai di hadapan Pemungut hendaklah, pada dan selepas permulaan kuat kuasa Akta ini, diteruskan dan diselesaikan seolah-olah Akta ibu tidak dipinda oleh Akta ini."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Harta Pusaka Kecil (Pembahagian) (Pindaan) 2007."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta. Pindaan am"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Harta Pusaka Kecil (Pembahagian) 1955 [Akta 98], yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Akta ini, dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “Collector” di mana-mana jua terdapat, kecuali dalam perenggan (b) dalam takrif “Collector” dalam seksyen 2, dengan perkataan “Land Administrator”. Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 2 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan sebelum takrif “Director General of Lands and Mines” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Corporation” means the Amanah Raya Berhad, a company incorporated under the Companies Act 1965 [Act 125] pursuant to section 3 of the Public Trust Corporation Act 1995 [Act 532];’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong takrif “Official Administrator”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif “State”, dengan menggantikan noktah dengan koma bertitik; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “State” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “valuation officer” means a valuation officer employed by the Government and includes an assistant valuation officer.’. Pindaan seksyen 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 3(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “six hundred thousand ringgit” dengan perkataan “two million ringgit”. Pindaan seksyen 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 4 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “the greater part in value of the property is situated” dengan perkataan “a petition has been lodged or in the case of more than one petition has been lodged, the Land Administrator of the district where the first petition has been lodged,”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan “shall determine” perkataan “or a valuation officer”. Pindaan seksyen 8"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/48/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
